  "provider_query": "Public Telegram web preview of the official Telegram channel",
  "answer": "Public web preview of Telegram’s official channels uses the first-party `t.me/s/` pages (no app or login). These are the main official ones and related entry points.\n\n1. **Telegram News (@telegram)** — official product channel (“The official Telegram on Telegram”). Web preview: [https://t.me/s/telegram](https://t.me/s/telegram). About ~9–11M subscribers in recent previews.  \n   Source: Telegram FAQ names `t.me/telegram` as the public example; live preview at `t.me/s/telegram`. [web:10] [web:12]\n\n2. **Pavel Durov (@durov)** — founder’s channel (“Founder of Telegram”). Web preview: [https://t.me/s/durov](https://t.me/s/durov). About ~10M+ subscribers.  \n   Source: public preview pages. [web:20] [web:21]\n\n3. **How the official preview works** — every public channel at `t.me/name` has a browser preview at `t.me/s/name` (recent posts as HTML; optional `?before=<post-id>` to page back).  \n   Source: descriptions of Telegram’s public preview endpoint. [web:1] [web:2] [web:9]\n\n4. **Channel link vs preview** — `t.me/telegram` opens in the app or a join-style page; `t.me/s/telegram` is the readable web preview.  \n   Source: Telegram channel FAQ and preview docs. [web:10] [web:9]\n\n5. **Official announcements policy** — Telegram states official announcements are published only at telegram.org and its official channels; other sites claiming to speak for the team are likely scams.  \n   Source: post text on the Telegram News preview. [web:16]\n\n6. **Embed public posts** — open a public post URL (e.g. `t.me/durov/43`) in a browser and use the embed option for widgets.  \n   Source: Telegram Core “Post Widget”. [web:7]\n\n7. **Where Telegram points users for updates** — official blog at telegram.org plus in-app channels such as @Telegram (and @Durov for founder updates), not third-party social accounts claimed as official.  \n   Source: support/contact roundup citing Telegram’s own channels. [web:11]\n\n8. **Direct preview URLs to open now**  \n   - [https://t.me/s/telegram](https://t.me/s/telegram)  \n   - [https://t.me/s/durov](https://t.me/s/durov)  \n\nSubscriber counts on previews change over time and are shown only as approximate snapshots from those pages.",
